001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     TOPNCMT2.
001300 AUTHOR.         CA YODER.
001400*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.   JANUARY 2001.
001600 DATE-COMPILED.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.
001900*         INVOICING OPEN COMMITTMENT REPORT
001900*                   BY PO HEADER
002000*
002100***************************************************************
002200***************************************************************
002300***                  T O P N C M T 2                        ***
002300***           (COPIED FROM TOPNCMT AND MODIFIED)            ***
002400***                                                         ***
002500***      THIS PROGRAM WILL PRINT OPEN COMMITTMENTS ON       ***
002600***      PURCHASE ORDERS BY PO HEADER.  THE PROGRAM         ***
002700***      TOPNCMT SELECTS RECORDS BASED ON INVOICE ITEMS;    ***
002800***      THIS VERSION SHOWS THE BUDGET AMOUNT ON THE PO     ***
002900***      HEADER.  IT ALSO SHOWS PAID AMOUNT BY PO--NOT BY   ***
003000***      PO ITEM.                                           ***
003100***                                                         ***
003200***      THE REPORT WILL BE SORTED BY BUDGET NUMBER.        ***
003300***                                                         ***
003400***      THIS PROGRAM WAS REQUESTED BY DANVILLE.            ***
003500***                                                         ***
004500***************************************************************
005600***************************************************************
010200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
010300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
010400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
010500 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
010600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
010700 FILE-CONTROL.
010800       SELECT DISC-PRT     ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
010900       SELECT SORTED-PRINT-FILE  ASSIGN TO DISK-SORTED.
011000       SELECT SORT-FILE          ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
011100
             SELECT DPORECD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MSTORERM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DINVRCD-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2502
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MPLTINFO-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
011200 DATA DIVISION.
011300 FILE SECTION.
011400
