120500*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
120600*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
120700*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
120800*                                                          *
