121100*                                                          *
121200*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
121300************************************************************
121400************************************************************
       991-SMALL-TABLE.
           MOVE BU-MSG TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG.
           MOVE "TABLE SIZE"       TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           IF BU-FILE = "PO "
              MOVE "PO/RLSE    "   TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              MOVE PO-RCV-NO       TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4).
           IF BU-FILE = "SRT"
              MOVE "PO  AND ITEM"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              MOVE SRTD-PO         TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4).
121500 990-BLOWUP.
121600*----------  PURGE THE FILE
121700*    MOVE SPACES TO COMMAND.
121800*    MOVE "PURGE INVDISC.PUB,TEMP" TO COMMAND.
121900*    CALL INTRINSIC "COMMAND" USING COMMAND-IMAGE, COMMAND-ERROR,
122000*                                   COMMAND-PARM.
122100     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
122200           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
122300           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
122400 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
